### ==============================================================================
### FASE 3d: REST API CLIENT (DISPLAY ANGGARAN BIAYA & INVESTASI LINTAS DOKUMEN)
### Format: VS Code REST Client
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Ambil Token CSRF
# @name getCsrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf
Content-Type: application/json

###
@csrfToken = {{getCsrf.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 2. Login sebagai Akuntansi (Dya)
# @name loginAkuntansi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "dya@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. GET /api/expense-lines (Display Anggaran Biaya Lintas Dokumen)
# Mengembalikan { success: true, data: [...], meta: {...}, totals: {...} }
GET {{baseUrl}}/expense-lines?period_id=1&page=1&per_page=20
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. GET /api/expense-lines dengan Filter Banyak Unit & Status Dokumen
GET {{baseUrl}}/expense-lines?period_id=1&unit_id=1,2&doc_status=DIAJUKAN
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. GET /api/expense-lines dengan Filter Kelompok COA & Rentang Bulan Realisasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/expense-lines?period_id=1&coa_group_id=1&month_from=01&month_to=06
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. GET /api/expense-lines dengan Pencarian (Nama / Kode Barang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/expense-lines?period_id=1&search=Kertas
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. GET /api/investment-lines (Display Anggaran Investasi Lintas Dokumen)
# Mengembalikan { success: true, data: [...], meta: {...}, totals: {...} }
GET {{baseUrl}}/investment-lines?period_id=1&page=1&per_page=20
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. GET /api/investment-lines Filter Laptop & PC (Kompatibilitas Layar Khusus)
GET {{baseUrl}}/investment-lines?period_id=1&is_laptop_pc=true
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. GET /api/investment-lines dengan Filter Kategori, Prioritas & Unit
GET {{baseUrl}}/investment-lines?period_id=1&category_id=1&priority_id=1&unit_id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Ekspor Excel Display Anggaran Biaya (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?report=display-biaya&format=xlsx&period_id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Ekspor Excel Display Anggaran Investasi (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?report=display-investasi&format=xlsx&period_id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. Login sebagai PIC Unit 1 (Rina) - Menguji Unit Scoping
# @name loginPIC
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 13. PIC Melihat Baris Biaya (Hanya Unit dalam Hak Aksesnya, fail-closed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/expense-lines?period_id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 14. PIC Melihat Baris Investasi (Hanya Unit dalam Hak Aksesnya, fail-closed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/investment-lines?period_id=1
Content-Type: application/json
